OL,3,GNEWSABonfire causes large outdoor fire
OL,4,Ain dry field
OL,5,
OL,6,FA warning has been issued after a
OL,7,Fbonfire caused a large outdoor fire.
OL,9,FJersey Fire Service said it received
OL,10,Fmultiple calls just before 17:00 BST on
OL,11,FMonday to the incident near a path
OL,12,Fleading to Jersey Water's desalination
OL,13,Fplant in Corbiere.
OL,15,FThe service said 18 firefighters were
OL,16,Fdispatched to the fire, which had
OL,17,Fspread from a bonfire in a neighbouring
OL,18,Ffield of dry vegetation and then driven
OL,19,Fby strong winds.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
