OL,3,GNEWSABonfire causes large outdoor fire
OL,4,Ain dry field
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said people should
OL,7,Frefrain from lighting bonfires during
OL,8,Fstrong winds as the land remained "very
OL,9,Fdry" after recent heatwaves and despite
OL,10,Frecent rainfall.
